1
00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:28,426
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

2
00:00:28,620 --> 00:00:30,866
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

3
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:33,940
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

4
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:37,586
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

5
00:00:38,020 --> 00:00:40,026
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

6
00:00:40,260 --> 00:00:42,946
♪Calm but full of pearl♪

7
00:00:44,260 --> 00:00:45,920
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

8
00:00:46,440 --> 00:00:49,066
♪I rule my whole own whirl♪

9
00:01:02,799 --> 00:01:04,280
How come you're suddenly back alone?

10
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:05,000
Where's Duan Xiuming?

11
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:07,760
It's over.

12
00:01:08,200 --> 00:01:09,239
What's over?

13
00:01:10,799 --> 00:01:12,159
We're done.

14
00:01:14,359 --> 00:01:15,239
What happened?

15
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:16,959
Did he hurt you?

16
00:01:18,079 --> 00:01:19,280
I broke up with him.

17
00:01:21,040 --> 00:01:22,159
Grandma's still alive.

18
00:01:23,760 --> 00:01:24,799
No wonder...

19
00:01:26,359 --> 00:01:28,439
your uncle sent me to pick you up.

20
00:01:31,560 --> 00:01:32,760
I came back this time

21
00:01:33,439 --> 00:01:35,359
with no plan to leave quietly.

22
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:40,106
=Quite The Girl=

23
00:01:40,180 --> 00:01:40,826
(Adapted from the Tomato novel
"Quite The Girl.")

24
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:41,533
(Author: Wo Shafei Kuxin)

25
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,986
=Episode 15=

26
00:02:08,000 --> 00:02:08,639
Xiuming.

27
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:10,479
Everything's packed.

28
00:02:10,840 --> 00:02:12,800
Should we take this painting?

29
00:02:14,520 --> 00:02:15,639
(To me,)

30
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:17,199
(you're just a chess game.)

31
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,199
(And it's over.)

32
00:02:19,680 --> 00:02:20,800
(From the very start,)

33
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:23,319
(you were just a pawn
to help me escape.)

34
00:02:25,199 --> 00:02:25,960
Take it.

35
00:02:28,319 --> 00:02:28,960
Xiuming,

36
00:02:29,439 --> 00:02:32,439
this painting doesn't quite match

37
00:02:32,680 --> 00:02:33,840
your usual taste.

38
00:02:34,039 --> 00:02:36,080
I'm taking it to remind myself

39
00:02:37,159 --> 00:02:39,280
not to fall into the same trap twice.

40
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:40,319
So, Xiuming,

41
00:02:41,039 --> 00:02:43,080
where are we headed next?

42
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:44,599
Xizi City.

43
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:48,840
Didn't you and Miss Lu already...?

44
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:55,120
Is Lu Mingye the only girl in Xizi City?

45
00:03:06,039 --> 00:03:07,039
Where's my grandma?

46
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,439
Oh, you're back.

47
00:03:08,759 --> 00:03:09,479
But your grandma

48
00:03:09,479 --> 00:03:11,080
needs a quiet place to rest.

49
00:03:11,199 --> 00:03:12,360
What do you mean, Uncle?

50
00:03:12,879 --> 00:03:14,759
The doctor said she needs rest.

51
00:03:15,039 --> 00:03:16,639
But last time you saw her,

52
00:03:16,879 --> 00:03:18,120
she got too worked up.

53
00:03:18,319 --> 00:03:19,240
It's dangerous.

54
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,680
I've put her in a top care home.

55
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:24,319
Best food, best accommodation.

56
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,199
As long as you behave,

57
00:03:28,599 --> 00:03:30,599
your grandma can live comfortably.

58
00:03:31,759 --> 00:03:33,360
What do you have to worry about with me?

59
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:35,599
You always claim

60
00:03:35,599 --> 00:03:37,199
to be the most filial son.

61
00:03:37,199 --> 00:03:38,680
Everyone in Xizi City knows.

62
00:03:39,159 --> 00:03:40,080
If they learn

63
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,879
that Grandma's suffering
at the care home,

64
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:44,439
all that devoted-son image you've built

65
00:03:44,439 --> 00:03:45,639
and the Lu family's reputation

66
00:03:46,280 --> 00:03:47,199
go down the drain.

67
00:04:05,680 --> 00:04:07,120
If Dongchen Group of Xiangjiang

68
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,240
really is moving into Xizi City,

69
00:04:08,479 --> 00:04:10,439
the president's executive assistant
has to be Lu Qian.

70
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:35,680
Lu Mingyu?

71
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:36,920
What are you doing here?

72
00:04:38,399 --> 00:04:39,920
Dongchen's job posting

73
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,639
is open to anyone qualified.

74
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,199
Why can't I be here?

75
00:04:43,480 --> 00:04:44,240
You think

76
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:46,279
just anyone can join Dongchen?

77
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,600
At least I meet every item

78
00:04:49,079 --> 00:04:50,000
of the job requirements.

79
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:52,560
As for you,

80
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,639
know your own limits.

81
00:04:54,879 --> 00:04:56,600
Stop acting so smug.

82
00:04:56,959 --> 00:04:58,199
Studying abroad for a while makes you

83
00:04:58,199 --> 00:04:59,120
something special, huh?

84
00:04:59,639 --> 00:05:00,959
A lowlife's a lowlife.

85
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,680
No amount of dressing up
can change that.

86
00:05:03,959 --> 00:05:06,560
I'm determined to win today's interview.

87
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,680
You're just here

88
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:09,800
to make me look good.

89
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,519
All candidates, please get ready.

90
00:05:12,839 --> 00:05:14,480
The test for this special role

91
00:05:14,480 --> 00:05:15,519
is on-site painting.

92
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:17,079
No theme restrictions.

93
00:05:17,079 --> 00:05:18,199
Three-hour time limit.

94
00:05:18,519 --> 00:05:19,399
Please show

95
00:05:19,399 --> 00:05:21,199
your artistic skills and creativity.

96
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:28,639
Stop!

97
00:05:34,480 --> 00:05:35,560
Since you're here,

98
00:05:35,680 --> 00:05:37,000
you might as well help out.

99
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:38,319
Paint something good.

100
00:05:38,560 --> 00:05:39,600
And swap with me later.

101
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,519
Why should I?

102
00:05:43,920 --> 00:05:45,160
You think I'm clueless?

103
00:05:45,639 --> 00:05:47,800
You're still not over him.

104
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:50,720
You secretly checked out
his photo yesterday, right?

105
00:05:59,000 --> 00:05:59,959
Tell me,

106
00:06:00,199 --> 00:06:02,079
if I tell Dad about this,

107
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:03,680
how will he punish you?

108
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,160
Fine.

109
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:11,920
There we go.

110
00:06:12,439 --> 00:06:13,519
Do as you're told.

111
00:06:13,879 --> 00:06:14,959
It's better for both of us.

112
00:06:29,160 --> 00:06:31,040
Piece No. 8 shows solid skills.

113
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,839
And the tones are well controlled.

114
00:06:33,279 --> 00:06:34,680
This isn't just depicting,

115
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,319
it's more like expressing,

116
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,560
even constructing.

117
00:06:38,639 --> 00:06:39,600
Truly precious.

118
00:06:39,680 --> 00:06:40,720
I appreciate that.

119
00:06:41,399 --> 00:06:42,319
However...

120
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,439
this unique brushwork

121
00:06:44,439 --> 00:06:46,199
and color-layering habit

122
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,639
just look so familiar to me.

123
00:06:51,920 --> 00:06:52,639
Look.

124
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,519
This is the work of rising artist Y.

125
00:06:56,879 --> 00:06:59,160
The "torn" light-and-shadow treatment,

126
00:06:59,439 --> 00:07:01,279
the brushstroke pressure and direction,

127
00:07:01,279 --> 00:07:03,160
even the color-layering habit,

128
00:07:03,600 --> 00:07:05,839
all match strikingly in both paintings.

129
00:07:06,480 --> 00:07:07,879
This is no simple coincidence

130
00:07:07,879 --> 00:07:09,279
or just reference.

131
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,680
This is just plain copying and stealing

132
00:07:11,680 --> 00:07:14,360
from another artist's original style.

133
00:07:15,199 --> 00:07:16,000
I announce

134
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:17,759
you're disqualified from this interview.

135
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,160
And we reserve the right

136
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,959
to report this to the Art Association.

137
00:07:22,519 --> 00:07:23,199
(No.)

138
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:24,480
(I can fail the interview,)

139
00:07:24,600 --> 00:07:26,160
(but I can't be branded a copycat.)

140
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:27,279
This painting isn't mine.

141
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:30,000
You can cancel my interview,

142
00:07:30,199 --> 00:07:32,120
but I'm not the copycat.

143
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,240
She painted this!

144
00:07:39,079 --> 00:07:39,879
That's right.

145
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:42,399
This painting is indeed mine.

146
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:45,399
But it's not copying.

147
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:46,839
It's progress.

148
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,319
This unique creative technique

149
00:07:51,399 --> 00:07:53,480
is indeed my own habit.

150
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,360
And Y

151
00:07:54,720 --> 00:07:56,360
is the pen name

152
00:07:56,360 --> 00:07:57,319
I often use overseas.

153
00:08:02,839 --> 00:08:04,680
This photo can prove my identity.

154
00:08:05,040 --> 00:08:06,079
If you need the original,

155
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,560
I can go home and get it.

156
00:08:07,800 --> 00:08:08,879
As for why my painting

157
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,879
ended up with Miss Lu Qian,

158
00:08:11,600 --> 00:08:12,439
I'm afraid

159
00:08:13,600 --> 00:08:15,360
she needs to explain

160
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:17,240
what exactly happened

161
00:08:17,439 --> 00:08:18,879
before it was submitted.

162
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:21,613
♪All disguise I keep in sight♪

163
00:08:22,120 --> 00:08:24,493
♪Wait for the chance to win the fight♪

164
00:08:25,319 --> 00:08:26,360
Miss Lu Mingyu,

165
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,759
so you're the real surprise

166
00:08:27,759 --> 00:08:29,079
of today's interview.

167
00:08:29,319 --> 00:08:31,040
Your talent, your courage,

168
00:08:31,040 --> 00:08:32,639
and your mastery of the work

169
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:33,799
are truly impressive.

170
00:08:34,960 --> 00:08:37,120
On behalf of Dongchen,
we officially welcome you aboard.

171
00:08:37,720 --> 00:08:39,106
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

172
00:08:39,640 --> 00:08:41,493
♪Good girl, good girl♪

173
00:08:43,540 --> 00:08:44,346
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

174
00:08:44,799 --> 00:08:45,960
(If Dongchen Group of Xiangjiang)

175
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,159
(really is moving into Xizi City,)

176
00:08:47,480 --> 00:08:49,399
(the president's executive assistant
has to be Lu Qian.)

177
00:08:49,940 --> 00:08:51,360
♪Do you think I'm a good girl?♪

178
00:08:51,399 --> 00:08:52,840
(The Lu family needs an outsider)

179
00:08:53,360 --> 00:08:55,600
(to shake things up.)

180
00:08:56,639 --> 00:08:57,600
(And Dongchen)

181
00:08:58,039 --> 00:08:59,559
(is the best lever.)

182
00:09:00,200 --> 00:09:02,799
(The executive assistant must be me.)

183
00:09:02,900 --> 00:09:05,200
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

184
00:09:05,860 --> 00:09:08,413
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

185
00:09:08,620 --> 00:09:11,386
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

186
00:09:11,900 --> 00:09:14,400
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

187
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,860
♪Break the chain, erase the curl♪

188
00:09:18,220 --> 00:09:20,880
♪I rise up with my inner pearl♪

189
00:09:21,300 --> 00:09:23,880
♪Self-rescue fire burning full♪

190
00:09:24,660 --> 00:09:26,893
♪I'm the master of my rule♪

191
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:33,759
Hello, sir.

192
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,840
I'm the new executive assistant,

193
00:09:35,879 --> 00:09:36,720
Lu Mingyu.

194
00:09:37,039 --> 00:09:37,960
I'm reporting for duty.

195
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:05,306
♪Wherever you go♪

196
00:10:05,860 --> 00:10:07,613
♪Oh, you♪

197
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:10,413
♪Wherever you are♪

198
00:10:11,580 --> 00:10:14,080
♪Wherever you go♪

199
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:18,533
♪Wherever you go♪

200
00:10:19,380 --> 00:10:21,240
♪For you♪

201
00:10:21,460 --> 00:10:24,280
♪Wherever you are♪

202
00:10:24,980 --> 00:10:25,946
♪Wherever you go♪

203
00:10:26,000 --> 00:10:26,759
My ex.

204
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,039
Fancy seeing you again.

205
00:11:07,450 --> 00:11:11,980
♪Snapping the sweetest noon♪

206
00:11:14,570 --> 00:11:18,143
♪The sun and you are gentle♪

207
00:11:21,530 --> 00:11:26,050
♪Summer wakes up right now♪

208
00:11:27,310 --> 00:11:32,210
♪Chimes and cicadas have loved so long♪

209
00:11:34,850 --> 00:11:41,050
♪A love letter written in song♪

210
00:11:41,610 --> 00:11:46,303
♪A gentle kiss upon your brow♪

211
00:11:48,930 --> 00:11:54,916
♪Dragonflies glide as butterflies dance♪

212
00:11:55,690 --> 00:12:01,263
♪We mark this moment with a kite♪

213
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:08,890
♪Gemini's joy lets art fill our love♪

214
00:12:09,950 --> 00:12:11,970
♪Close your eyes and count♪

215
00:12:12,250 --> 00:12:16,670
♪The starry sky is my gift to you♪

216
